Omission
- [N1] Node-level omission: after a week (reason: The explicit timing constraint from the source is completely absent from all model elements.)
- [N2] Node-level omission: send the order for sign off (reason: Following the 'upon receiving the actual issue' step, the source explicitly instructs to send the order for sign off. No corresponding action or transition exists in the model.)
- [N3] Node-level omission: i20:If the order needs to be cancelled, the process ends. (reason: The cancellation condition triggering an early process end is entirely missing. The model proceeds directly to end nodes without evaluating this prerequisite.)
